  "contentHtml": "<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">KBS </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">파노라마에서는 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">동영상이라는 컨텐츠가 </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">요즘 세대 학생들에게 더 친숙하고 집중하기 좋은 도구라고&nbsp;있습니다</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">정말 그럴까요?</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><STRONG>(동영상 매체의 효과에 대한 의문)</STRONG></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><!--StartFragment--></SPAN></SPAN>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 10</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">분짜리 영상에 해당하는 내용을 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">수업에서 교사가 직접 설명하는 것은 </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; 효과가 떨어질까요</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">? (<EM> 더지만두님 : 자꾸 교사만 얘기하니....학생들이 졸린것 같아요</EM>)</P><!-- --><!-- end clix_content --></SPAN>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><!--StartFragment--></SPAN></SPAN>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2.&nbsp;학생 각자 집이나 테블릿으로 영상물을 보는 것이</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; 교실에서 강의를 듣는 것보다 효과적인가</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">? (여러 번 볼 수 있기 때문에 효과가 있다?)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></P></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><!--StartFragment--></SPAN></SPAN>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. 임용고사 준비를 위해 인강을 보지 않고, </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">일부러 </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교육학 학원을 다니는 이유는</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">?</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">4. 교사대상 사이버 연수는 왜 그렇게 재미가 없을까? 왜 집중이 잘 안될까?</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><STRONG><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">(동영상을 교사가 보았을 때의 시사점)</SPAN></STRONG></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><STRONG></STRONG></SPAN></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\">&nbsp;A교사가 B교사의 동영상을 보고 나서</SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\">1. 아 이렇게도 설명할 수 있구나! </SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\">2. 내가 오개념을 갖고 있었네!</SPAN></SPAN></P><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;교과전문성을 신장하는데 도움이 많이 되네요^^</P></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\">\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P></SPAN></SPAN>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P></SPAN></SPAN>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
